    "description": {
      "value": "<p>If you surprise a creature and hit it with an attack on your first turn in combat, the attack deals an extra 1d6 damage to it. The damage increases to 2d6 at 6th level, 3d6 at 11th level, and 4d6 at 16th level. You can use this trait only once per combat.</p>",
